# With two Exalted Sunborns out, both replacements apply to Royal Treatment's Royal Role, one after the other in the
# order Bot1 chooses (CR 616.1): one becomes two, then four (CR 614.1a). All four are created attached to the targeted
# Sunborn, and the state-based action keeps one of the four, the rest going to the graveyard, where tokens cease to exist
# (CR 704.5z, 704.5d). That Sunborn is a 5/6, the other a 4/5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Exalted Sunborn
Exalted Sunborn
Royal Treatment
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

